# Purple Dragon Punks: "Spend this mana only to cast an artifact spell or to activate an ability" (CR 106.6). Turn 3: the
# Mox Ruby's {R} casts Sol Ring first, so Punks' restricted {R} is the only red mana left, and Lightning Bolt, a
# nonartifact spell, can't be paid with it (the Mox Jet's {B} can't pay {R}): it is not offered, and Bot2 stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Purple Dragon Punks
Lightning Bolt
Sol Ring
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Purple Dragon Punks.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Purple Dragon Punks.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (AnyOf(ArtifactSpells+Abilities))
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Mana: short)
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (AnyOf(ArtifactSpells+Abilities))

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Colors = Red
Bot2.Life = 20
